  "description": "With a mother who favors only her eldest son, a father who can’t stand up to his son, and a violent older brother, Tae-woong has never had a single moment of peace—until Je-heon suddenly appears in his life. Seeing Tae-woong’s body, which is always covered in bruises, Je-heon feels compelled to save him. But the closer they grow, the more Tae-woong tries to hide his true self, and Je-heon, who knows the truth, can only feel deeper sorrow...\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/darkside/)",
